1
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:39,372
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:56,139
{\an8}<font color="white">SLOVAKIA, 5 YEARS AGO</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:57,348
<font color="white">Brother Luca.</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,103
<font color="white">How are you feeling today?</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,648
<font color="white">I'm fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:08,485
<font color="white">Thank you for your concern.</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:09,694 --> 00:01:10,528
<font color="white">This here.</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:10,612 --> 00:01:12,363
<font color="white">When I went into town,</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:15,200
<font color="white">I heard there was</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">an Asian man like you, Brother,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

10
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:16,618
<font color="white">who was performing.</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:20,121
<font color="white">So I brought this back with me,</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:24,292
<font color="white">thinking it might help you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">regain your memory.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

13
00:01:26,294 --> 00:01:27,462
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:59,661 --> 00:02:01,121
<font color="white"><i>Play freely like that day.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:03,540
<font color="white">It's all your fault!</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:50,795 --> 00:02:51,796
<font color="white"><i>Kang Pi-o.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:59,178 --> 00:03:03,516
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:04,893 --> 00:03:06,686
{\an8}<font color="white">EPISODE 8</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:24,329 --> 00:03:27,749
{\an8}<font color="white">JAE-IN:</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'M SORRY, PI-O. ARE YOU STILL UPSET?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

20
00:03:31,419 --> 00:03:32,378
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>No.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:32,962 --> 00:03:34,172
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'll call you later.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:43,139 --> 00:03:45,558
<font color="white">I know everyone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">keeps calling him a genius,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

23
00:03:45,642 --> 00:03:47,560
<font color="white">but isn't it a bit much</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:47,644 --> 00:03:50,355
<font color="white">to bring in a 27-year-old rookie</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as a principal guest conductor?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

25
00:03:50,438 --> 00:03:53,024
<font color="white">But Maestro Kang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">wouldn't bring in just anyone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

26
00:03:53,816 --> 00:03:56,736
<font color="white">I watched the Brno competition video,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and he was really good.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

27
00:03:56,819 --> 00:03:57,820
<font color="white">He's good?</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:59,197 --> 00:04:00,240
<font color="white">Good at what?</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:03,326
<font color="white">Was he good, or was the orchestra good?</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:03,409 --> 00:04:05,036
<font color="white">Guess we'll find out soon enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:05,536 --> 00:04:06,412
<font color="white">Hey, Jang Seok-hwan.</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:06,955 --> 00:04:09,499
<font color="white">Are you jealous</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that your classmate is the new conductor?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

33
00:04:09,582 --> 00:04:10,500
<font color="white">Why so touchy?</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:11,459 --> 00:04:12,669
<font color="white">I'm not jealous.</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:12,752 --> 00:04:16,047
<font color="white">I'll test him by coming in</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">half a beat early at measure 11.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

36
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:18,049
<font color="white">I can bet all of my fingers</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:18,132 --> 00:04:19,926
<font color="white">that he won't even notice.</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:20,009 --> 00:04:21,302
<font color="white">Nobody would catch that</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:21,386 --> 00:04:22,470
<font color="white">unless it's Maestro Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:47,829 --> 00:04:49,289
<font color="white">Hello, everyone.</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:49,831 --> 00:04:52,750
<font color="white">As we announced, starting today,</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:52,834 --> 00:04:56,671
<font color="white">our new principal guest conductor,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Luca Domenico, will lead the rehearsals.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

43
00:04:56,754 --> 00:04:59,257
<font color="white">Let me now introduce you to him.</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:59,966 --> 00:05:00,800
<font color="white">It's all yours.</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:05,054 --> 00:05:06,139
<font color="white">Hello.</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:06,723 --> 00:05:09,350
<font color="white">I'm Luca Domenico.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I look forward to working with you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

47
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:15,982
<font color="white">We all know he's Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:16,065 --> 00:05:18,234
<font color="white">"Luca Domenico"? That's so lame.</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:21,321 --> 00:05:22,697
<font color="white">Just to let you know,</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:23,781 --> 00:05:27,452
<font color="white">if you have any complaints or suggestions,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">please tell me directly.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

51
00:05:27,952 --> 00:05:29,454
<font color="white">If you don't have the nerve,</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:30,455 --> 00:05:31,289
<font color="white">don't say anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:38,004
<font color="white">The only thing we should be debating</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in this rehearsal room is the music.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

54
00:05:38,504 --> 00:05:39,505
<font color="white">All right then.</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:40,131 --> 00:05:42,425
<font color="white">Brahms' first movement, from the top.</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:45,655 --> 00:06:48,825
<font color="white">One of the cellos is late on the attack</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at measure 11.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

57
00:06:50,326 --> 00:06:51,202
<font color="white">Principal cello?</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:56,499
<font color="white">I think I slipped up.</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:56,582 --> 00:06:58,042
<font color="white">I'm really sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:58,835 --> 00:07:00,002
<font color="white">I have to say,</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:07:00,086 --> 00:07:02,213
<font color="white">the attack wasn't late. It was early.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:07:03,589 --> 00:07:06,926
<font color="white">I guess you're not so accurate after all.</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:07:07,927 --> 00:07:09,428
<font color="white">-No, it was late.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-No.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

64
00:07:10,346 --> 00:07:11,514
<font color="white">It was early.</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:07:11,597 --> 00:07:13,057
<font color="white">You, the one speaking right now.</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:07:13,141 --> 00:07:15,852
<font color="white">Do you realize what a bad habit you have?</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:07:17,019 --> 00:07:19,439
<font color="white">Some musicians with this bad habit</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:22,608
<font color="white">drag out the first note of a phrase.</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:26,320
<font color="white">So even if the bow moves first,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the sound comes out delayed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

70
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:31,284
<font color="white">That bad habit is why</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your sound is ever so slightly delayed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

71
00:07:32,326 --> 00:07:34,829
<font color="white">The fact that you weren't</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even aware of this means</font><font color="white"></font></font>

72
00:07:36,205 --> 00:07:39,167
<font color="white">you clearly haven't been</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">practicing enough.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

73
00:07:40,042 --> 00:07:42,503
<font color="white">And the other members</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are suffering the consequences.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

74
00:07:45,715 --> 00:07:48,050
<font color="white">A good instrument alone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">doesn't make good music.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:07:48,885 --> 00:07:50,178
<font color="white">Put in some effort.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:50,761 --> 00:07:51,721
<font color="white">Real effort.</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:53,181 --> 00:07:54,724
<font color="white">First movement, from the top.</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:08:10,281 --> 00:08:12,825
<font color="white">You're much more savvy than I expected.</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:08:14,118 --> 00:08:15,745
<font color="white">I knew you had an amazing ear,</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:08:15,828 --> 00:08:17,705
<font color="white">but how are you so good</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with an orchestra too?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

81
00:08:18,998 --> 00:08:21,417
<font color="white">Oh, right.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">There's a guest waiting for you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

82
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:24,337
<font color="white">For me?</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,755
<font color="white">Yes, for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:44,815 --> 00:08:47,068
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:47,151 --> 00:08:49,028
<font color="white">Do you recognize me?</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:08:51,197 --> 00:08:53,449
<font color="white">I used to teach you piano.</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:54,909 --> 00:08:56,327
<font color="white">I'm Do Hyun-soo.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:05,336
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:09:05,419 --> 00:09:06,629
<font color="white">-I don't--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

90
00:09:09,257 --> 00:09:10,550
<font color="white">Thank you so much.</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:09:14,595 --> 00:09:16,097
<font color="white">Can I give you a hug?</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:09:17,682 --> 00:09:18,516
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:09:29,610 --> 00:09:31,529
<font color="white">I'm sorry I didn't come sooner.</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:09:32,947 --> 00:09:35,491
<font color="white">I knew you were busy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">adjusting to the new environment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

95
00:09:36,075 --> 00:09:39,161
<font color="white">I didn't want to add to that,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I just waited.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

96
00:09:42,331 --> 00:09:43,833
<font color="white">After you went missing,</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:48,170
<font color="white">Ms. Yoon and I searched for you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for a long time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

98
00:09:51,591 --> 00:09:55,469
<font color="white">I never imagined you'd be at a monastery.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:57,221 --> 00:09:58,556
<font color="white">Why go to such lengths?</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:10:00,975 --> 00:10:03,978
<font color="white">Because you were a student</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I cared about deeply.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

101
00:10:04,478 --> 00:10:07,356
<font color="white">And because I was the one</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who sent you there.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:10:08,316 --> 00:10:11,068
<font color="white">I felt terrible that I didn't stop you</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:10:12,278 --> 00:10:15,615
<font color="white">when you first approached me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about entering the competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

104
00:10:16,198 --> 00:10:18,659
<font color="white">You were doing fine on your own,</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:10:19,577 --> 00:10:20,870
<font color="white">but I dragged you into this world.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:10:22,079 --> 00:10:23,414
<font color="white">I really regretted that.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:10:28,544 --> 00:10:29,712
<font color="white">But I'm so thankful</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:10:30,296 --> 00:10:31,797
<font color="white">that you made it back.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:10:32,798 --> 00:10:36,260
<font color="white">I heard you told Ms. Yoon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that you wanted to perform with Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

110
00:10:38,262 --> 00:10:40,306
<font color="white">I watched some of</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">his performance videos,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

111
00:10:40,389 --> 00:10:42,975
<font color="white">and I thought we'd have good chemistry.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:10:45,227 --> 00:10:46,562
<font color="white">You wouldn't have any memory of it.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:10:47,521 --> 00:10:50,399
<font color="white">Was it just a feeling,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">or did your instincts tell you that?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

114
00:10:52,026 --> 00:10:53,402
<font color="white">Back in high school,</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:54,153 --> 00:10:57,406
<font color="white">you and Pi-o were partners</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with great musical chemistry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

116
00:10:58,908 --> 00:11:00,493
<font color="white">I really hope</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:11:01,285 --> 00:11:03,788
<font color="white">you can persuade Pi-o</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to return to the stage.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

118
00:11:04,914 --> 00:11:08,292
<font color="white"><i>Pi-o had a pretty rough time</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>after falling into a slump.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:11:08,376 --> 00:11:09,835
<font color="white"><i>You're aware of this, right?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:52,128 --> 00:11:53,546
<font color="white">MESSAGE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">NEW NOTIFICATION</font><font color="white"></font></font>

121
00:12:00,052 --> 00:12:01,387
<font color="white"><i>Can we meet up briefly?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:12:06,809 --> 00:12:08,894
<font color="white">Why don't you want to perform with me?</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:12:09,854 --> 00:12:11,981
<font color="white">Are you still afraid of going on stage,</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:12:12,773 --> 00:12:14,567
<font color="white">or are you uncomfortable</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">performing with me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

125
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:18,279
<font color="white">To be exact, it's both.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:12:18,946 --> 00:12:20,739
<font color="white">You've probably heard from Jae-in,</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:22,199
<font color="white">but a while back…</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:12:26,454 --> 00:12:29,123
<font color="white">I made a huge mistake while performing.</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,542
<font color="white">I haven't gotten over it yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:32,126 --> 00:12:33,502
<font color="white">I appreciate the offer,</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:36,338
<font color="white">but you should perform with someone else.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:40,968 --> 00:12:43,262
<font color="white">If that's the case,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">then I really don't get it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

133
00:12:43,345 --> 00:12:44,722
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:44,805 --> 00:12:45,848
<font color="white">I mean,</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:46,724 --> 00:12:50,728
<font color="white">avoiding a slump</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">isn't going to solve anything.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

136
00:12:50,811 --> 00:12:53,731
<font color="white">You need to face it at some point.</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:54,315 --> 00:12:55,357
<font color="white">Don't you agree?</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:56,192 --> 00:12:58,611
<font color="white">Ignoring the problem won't solve anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:59,361 --> 00:13:01,780
<font color="white">You need to face it at some point.</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:13:09,038 --> 00:13:10,581
<font color="white">Thanks for the advice,</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:12,166
<font color="white">but I'll handle my own business.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,876
<font color="white">Look for someone else.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:13:36,190 --> 00:13:37,900
<font color="white">Jeez, Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:38,651 --> 00:13:41,111
<font color="white">You've always had a knack for surprises.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:41,195 --> 00:13:44,073
<font color="white">But you should've told me, you punk.</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:44,865 --> 00:13:47,493
<font color="white">I almost had a heart attack</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I saw the news.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

147
00:13:47,576 --> 00:13:50,204
<font color="white">I told you not to worry,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but I guess you did.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

148
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:53,415
<font color="white">How could I not worry?</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:57,336
<font color="white">You never showed your face,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but you said you were alive.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

150
00:13:57,419 --> 00:13:59,213
<font color="white">I didn't know what to believe.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:00,839
<font color="white">How's my father?</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:14:00,923 --> 00:14:02,341
<font color="white">Oh jeez.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:14:05,844 --> 00:14:07,179
<font color="white">He's doing fine!</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:14:07,930 --> 00:14:10,558
<font color="white">I do have to track him down</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whenever he sneaks out of the hospital</font><font color="white"></font></font>

155
00:14:10,641 --> 00:14:11,642
<font color="white">to drink himself silly.</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:14:11,725 --> 00:14:14,562
<font color="white">When I see you wasting money</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on that dirtbag,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

157
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,188
<font color="white">I swear you look like a pushover.</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:20,276 --> 00:14:21,527
<font color="white">By the way,</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:22,027 --> 00:14:23,779
<font color="white">when did you learn how to conduct?</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:28,450 --> 00:14:29,285
