646
00:52:42,075 --> 00:52:43,994
<font color="white">If your fear threatens to take over,</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:52:44,744 --> 00:52:47,122
<font color="white">imagine performances in your head.</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:52:48,331 --> 00:52:49,416
<font color="white">Then at some point,</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:52:50,584 --> 00:52:53,086
<font color="white">your fear will fade far into the distance.</font><font color="white"></font>

650
00:52:53,879 --> 00:52:55,380
<font color="white">And I know it'll be hard…</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:52:57,215 --> 00:52:59,217
<font color="white">but try to put your complete trust in me.</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:53:00,010 --> 00:53:02,178
<font color="white">Because I control the orchestra.</font><font color="white"></font>

653
00:53:03,221 --> 00:53:05,390
<font color="white">Would you like to hear my imaginary music?</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:53:08,059 --> 00:53:10,020
<font color="white">And if possible…</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:53:11,897 --> 00:53:13,356
<font color="white">it'd be nice if you played the piano.</font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:53:40,967 --> 00:53:41,843
<font color="white">Violin.</font><font color="white"></font>

657
00:53:42,802 --> 00:53:43,720
<font color="white">Pianissimo.</font><font color="white"></font>

658
00:53:55,732 --> 00:53:56,691
<font color="white">Cellos and basses.</font><font color="white"></font>

659
00:54:06,326 --> 00:54:08,078
<font color="white">Oboes and flutes, espressivo.</font><font color="white"></font>

660
00:54:33,186 --> 00:54:34,354
<font color="white">Timpani, forte!</font><font color="white"></font>

661
00:54:56,334 --> 00:54:57,335
<font color="white">Piano.</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:54:58,920 --> 00:55:00,046
<font color="white"><i>Con dolore.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:57:29,195 --> 00:57:30,321
<font color="white">Oh, hello.</font><font color="white"></font>

664
00:57:31,698 --> 00:57:34,492
<font color="white">Thank you for your support</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for today's performance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

665
00:57:34,576 --> 00:57:36,578
<font color="white">I hope you'll write</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a nice article about it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

666
00:57:37,245 --> 00:57:38,788
<font color="white">Gosh, don't mention it.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:57:39,581 --> 00:57:41,124
<font color="white">Yes, please keep in touch.</font><font color="white"></font>

668
00:57:47,630 --> 00:57:48,590
<font color="white">My goodness.</font><font color="white"></font>

669
00:57:49,424 --> 00:57:52,677
<font color="white">I had to fight back tears at the end.</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:57:53,386 --> 00:57:56,097
<font color="white">I can't believe you two</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">made me so emotional.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

671
00:57:56,723 --> 00:58:00,143
<font color="white">Thank you both</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for supporting me all the way.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

672
00:58:00,226 --> 00:58:01,978
<font color="white">Not at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:58:02,645 --> 00:58:04,230
<font color="white">I was really nervous too,</font><font color="white"></font>

674
00:58:05,482 --> 00:58:08,151
<font color="white">but you shocked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with your amazing performance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

675
00:58:09,194 --> 00:58:12,572
<font color="white">Hey, why don't you guys</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">perform something amazing</font><font color="white"></font></font>

676
00:58:12,655 --> 00:58:15,033
<font color="white">at the 80th anniversary festival too?</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:58:15,116 --> 00:58:17,744
<font color="white">Let's turn you two into a brand.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

678
00:58:18,620 --> 00:58:19,579
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

679
00:58:22,707 --> 00:58:26,127
<font color="white">Gosh, I can barely talk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with all these calls coming in.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

680
00:58:26,628 --> 00:58:27,587
<font color="white">Give me a second.</font><font color="white"></font>

681
00:58:30,131 --> 00:58:31,090
<font color="white">Hi, thanks for calling.</font><font color="white"></font>

682
00:58:34,010 --> 00:58:34,844
<font color="white">Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:58:36,304 --> 00:58:37,138
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

684
00:58:38,598 --> 00:58:40,183
<font color="white">Now that our performance has wrapped up,</font><font color="white"></font>

685
00:58:41,226 --> 00:58:43,144
<font color="white">I wanted to tell you something.</font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:58:47,815 --> 00:58:50,276
<font color="white">By any chance…</font><font color="white"></font>

687
00:58:58,618 --> 00:59:01,037
<font color="white"><i>I found out who ordered</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Choi Jeong-yo's abduction.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:59:05,667 --> 00:59:06,543
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

689
00:59:07,460 --> 00:59:08,461
<font color="white">Is something wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:59:09,629 --> 00:59:10,588
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

691
00:59:11,965 --> 00:59:12,840
<font color="white">Just a minute.</font><font color="white"></font>

692
00:59:28,481 --> 00:59:31,109
<font color="white">I FOUND OUT WHO ORDERED</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO'S ABDUCTION.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

693
01:00:32,378 --> 01:00:34,505
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

694
01:00:35,590 --> 01:00:36,758
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Why did you do it, Mom?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

695
01:00:36,841 --> 01:00:38,468
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>We'll confess to Jeong-yo</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and ask for his forgiveness.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

696
01:00:38,551 --> 01:00:39,969
{\an8}<font color="white">No, I won't go!</font><font color="white"></font>

697
01:00:40,053 --> 01:00:41,429
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>If the truth comes out,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

698
01:00:41,512 --> 01:00:44,140
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>both of our lives will be over.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

699
01:00:44,223 --> 01:00:45,391
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>You don't look well.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

700
01:00:45,475 --> 01:00:46,893
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Are you hiding something from me?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

701
01:00:46,976 --> 01:00:49,479
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I didn't have the courage</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to tell you the truth before.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

702
01:00:49,562 --> 01:00:51,272
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>What if he's up to something?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

703
01:00:51,356 --> 01:00:54,108
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'm terrified</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>he's getting in your way on purpose.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

704
01:00:54,192 --> 01:00:55,193
{\an8}<font color="white">He's hiding something.</font><font color="white"></font>

705
01:00:56,569 --> 01:00:57,862
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'm here to ask for your forgiveness.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

706
01:00:58,905 --> 01:01:00,782
{\an8}<font color="white">Nine years ago</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the Harmonie International Competition…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

707
01:01:03,034 --> 01:01:08,039
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
